---
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Fonts"
  description="Information about fonts and language display for Cambodia Bible resources."
  currentPath="/fonts/"
>
  <section class="content-section prose-section">
    <p class="eyebrow">Reading support</p>
    <h2>Fonts and language display</h2>
    <p>
      Cambodia Bible resources are intended to be read in their language's
      writing system. The font used to display text can depend on your device,
      operating system, and the app or document you are using.
    </p>
    <p>
      If characters appear as empty boxes or do not display correctly, update
      your device and check that it supports the script used by that language.
      Font downloads and installation instructions will be added here when they
      are available.
    </p>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>
